${void ($.llmOptions = { model: "deepseek/deepseek-chat", temperature: 0 })}
${void ($._perFolderOps = [{ name: "inputFiles", arg: 0 }])}
${void ($._perFileOps = ["MultiSearch", "FillQuery", "Json"])}
${void ($._multiSearch = {
  searchModels: ["deepseek/deepseek-chat", "google/gemini-2.5-flash"],
  judgeModel: "deepseek/deepseek-chat",
  judgeQuery: 'You are the Chief Technology Officer acting as a definitive evaluation judge.\n\nReview the candidate designs below, submitted by independent models. Choose the winning design — the one that is more reliable, cost-effective, and operationally sound.\n\nSet "winner" to the index (0 or 1) of the best candidate. Include your justification in "analysis" and summarize the chosen architecture in "solution".\n\nCandidate designs:'
})}
${void ($._schema = {
  name: "architecture_evaluation",
  strict: true,
  schema: {
    type: "object",
    properties: {
      winner: { type: "integer" },
      analysis: { type: "string" },
      solution: { type: "string" }
    },
    required: ["winner", "analysis", "solution"],
    additionalProperties: false
  }
})}

You are a Principal Cloud Architect proposing an infrastructure design.

Design a high-availability solution for the following architectural challenge:

${$.data}

Provide an in-depth analysis and concrete solution. Set "winner" to 0 in your output.
